@startuml
title Simulation Flow

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Verdana"

skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor<<Frontend>> LightBlue
    BorderColor<<Frontend>> Blue
    BackgroundColor<<Backend>> LightGreen
    BorderColor<<Backend>> Green
    BackgroundColor<<Service>> LightYellow
    BorderColor<<Service>> Orange
    BackgroundColor<<Database>> LightGray
    BorderColor<<Database>> Black
}

participant "SimFront" as SimFront <<Frontend>>
participant "SimBack" as SimBack <<Backend>>
participant "CalcEngine" as CalcEngine <<Service>>
participant "SaSViya" as SaSViya <<Service>>
database "DB" as DB <<Database>>

SimFront -> SimBack: Request Simulation
activate SimBack

note right of SimBack: Orchestrating Request

SimBack -> CalcEngine: Request Calculation
activate CalcEngine
CalcEngine --> SimBack: Calculation Results
deactivate CalcEngine

SimBack -> SaSViya: Request Analytics
activate SaSViya
SaSViya --> SimBack: Analytics Results
deactivate SaSViya

SimBack -> DB: Persist Combined Results
activate DB
DB --> SimBack: Persistence Acknowledged
deactivate DB

SimBack --> SimFront: Simulation Response
deactivate SimBack

@enduml
